``` local-admin-creation v2 - PENDING VALIDATION ```
``` Not yet run against live data. query.spl remains the validated detection. ```
```
Fixes two defects in query.spl, both found in review rather than in testing:

1. Severity decays as the attacker keeps using the account.
   v1 sets span_min = max(_time) - min(_time) over every matching event
   for the SID, so it measures to the LAST 4624 in the search window. A
   create -> elevate -> logon chain completed in 4 minutes is scored high,
   but one more logon 90 minutes later stretches the span to 90 and the
   same chain drops to low. v2 measures creation to the FIRST logon after
   elevation, so later use can no longer lower the score.

2. Order is never enforced.
   v1 checks the three step names with values() and mvfind(). values()
   returns a sorted, de-duplicated set, so it proves each step happened
   but not in what order, while the README promises create -> elevate ->
   logon in that order. v2 requires the admin add at or after creation, and
   a logon at or after the admin add.

Also: 4732's TargetUserName is the group ("Administrators"), not the
account, so v1's usernames column included the group name. v2 excludes it.

Reproduce both defects with ../../validation/hec_scenarios.py (scenarios
admin-control, admin-decay, admin-order).
```
index=* (sourcetype=WinEventLog:Security OR sourcetype=XmlWinEventLog:Security OR sourcetype=*wineventlog*security*)
(EventCode=4720 OR EventCode=4732 OR EventCode=4624)
| eval sid=coalesce(TargetUserSid, MemberSid, TargetSid)
| eval event_type=case(
    EventCode=4720, "created",
    EventCode=4732 AND TargetSid="S-1-5-32-544", "added_to_admins",
    EventCode=4624, "logon"
  )
| where isnotnull(event_type)
| eval account=if(EventCode=4732, null(), TargetUserName)
``` step times are per SID, computed once and carried onto every event ```
| eventstats
    min(eval(if(event_type="created", _time, null()))) as created_time
    min(eval(if(event_type="added_to_admins", _time, null()))) as admin_time
  by sid
| where isnotnull(created_time) AND isnotnull(admin_time) AND admin_time>=created_time
``` only logons at or after elevation complete the chain ```
| eval logon_after_admin=if(event_type="logon" AND _time>=admin_time, _time, null())
| stats
    min(created_time) as created_time
    min(admin_time) as admin_time
    min(logon_after_admin) as first_logon_time
    count(logon_after_admin) as logons_after_admin
    values(account) as usernames
  by sid
| where isnotnull(first_logon_time)
| eval span_min=round((first_logon_time-created_time)/60,1)
| eval detection="local-admin-creation-first-logon"
| eval severity=case(span_min<=15, "high", span_min<=30, "medium", true(), "low")
| sort 0 - created_time
| convert ctime(created_time) ctime(admin_time) ctime(first_logon_time)
| table created_time admin_time first_logon_time sid usernames span_min logons_after_admin severity detection
